      "created_at": "2017-08-11T19:14:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>FLOW LIKE WATER REACH LIKE AIR</p><p>*ahem* this doesn't technically&nbsp;<em>push</em> a city, per se, but with the elemental threshold achieved, a spirit can move 2 cities with their presence.</p><p>Bonus points for using this power on Thunderspeaker with Dahan in the land, as they can move their presence right along with the dahan.</p><p>Pardon the caps, I was excited because we found this card last night, and we used it to allow Thunderspeaker to drag&nbsp;<em>everything</em>&nbsp;out of one land into another land with even more things for a total of two cities, three towns, and various explorers in the final land. then Lightning dropped one of the major cards that allowed for 12 damage and ended the game for us at terror level 2.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:30:09.085Z",
